        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Joel\n- Songs: \"The Entertainer\", \"Piano Man\"\n- Topics: song editing, 1973 releases\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Joel released \"Piano Man\" in 1973.\n- Billy Joel released \"The Entertainer\" after \"Piano Man\" and included a verse referencing that \"Piano Man\" had been shortened.\n- The verse in \"The Entertainer\" refers to the radio edit of \"Piano Man\" being cut down for release or airplay.",
